<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.3 Supervised fine-tuning with Behaviors ‣ 5 Experimental Results ‣ Metacognitive Reuse: Turning Recurring LLM Reasoning Into Concise Behaviors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Results.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
